types.doc:
Builds .mmodel files from 3D model sources (FBX, glTF, OBJ). The source is
translated into the import intermediate first (FImportTranslatorRegistry);
this class never sees a format library's own scene.

Loaded embedded light (v3+). Each instance references a node by index;
the editor's ModelInstantiator adds a LightComponent on that node's
entity at spawn time.
